<title>INDIA: Indian repo auction cut-off steady at 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Indian repo auction cut-off steady at 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Saturday it maintained the cut-off at 5.0 percent at its four-day repo auction of government of India securities.</p>
<p>All four bids were accepted for a total of 15.15 billion rupees it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
